    "updated_at": "2018-03-13T21:20:41Z",
    "body": "I dunno that there's any point to doing validation here.  Anything working with StaticRange needs to handle invalid ones somehow anyway.\r\n\r\nApart from that, the constructor generally makes sense to me, assuming we're doing StaticRange at all.  Are we?  Has anyone other than WebKit added it?  Where is WebKit using it?",
