    "created_at": "2019-08-06T11:12:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-06T11:13:45Z",
    "body": "There has been no further discussion that I'm aware of. I think we should restrict the types of nodes you can specify, but otherwise I don't think there's a need for validation here.\r\n\r\nAlso, to be clear, happy for you to drive this. We'll need web-platform-tests, bugs against implementations, and a PR against the DOM Standard (`dom.bs` in this repository).",
