    "created_at": "2019-08-07T13:51:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-07T13:51:55Z",
    "body": "Unless there's a good case for allowing `Attr` I'd rather be conservative as it's much easier to remove a restriction than to add one. In particular if there'll be APIs that take `StaticRange` but not `Range` this might be beneficial as they do not have to care about `Attr` at that point.",
