    "updated_at": "2019-08-07T22:15:49Z",
    "body": "That's a good point actually - we wouldn't want an author to take a dependency on `StaticRange` working with `Attr` if we don't want to support it long term. I certainly don't see a use case for why we would need to support it.\r\n\r\nSo are we fine with disallowing `DocumentType` and `Attr` then? If so, I can get going with the spec PR, tests and implementation bugs.",
